  "review_verdict": "Scoped clear for the radius-one, fixed-phase, thin-front test, including finite transverse leakage and exclusion of first-order equilibrium for the tested occupied profile.",
  "review_scope": "Independent arclength/frusta geometry, weak carrier and closed transverse cavity comparisons. The finite-drive work was checked against the primary energy differences. The 64-mesh independent weak-flow attempt failed its absolute flux tolerance and is excluded. The 32/64 independent wave attempts finished their closed modes before failing a separate unscaled Bessel check. Only their mode tables revalidated by the successful scaled-Hankel readout were used. The primary open mode and finite-drive fields have their own successful guards."
